# Files NOT uploaded to Cloudflare Workers Static Assets.
# SPA fallback is handled natively via wrangler.jsonc → assets.not_found_handling.
# _redirects and 404.html are kept in the repo for portability to Pages / Netlify /
# GitHub Pages but excluded from this deploy.
#
# Production loads /dist/*.js (built from src/*.jsx by `npm run build`).
# src/ and tests/ stay out of the deploy — they're source material only.
.git
.git/**
.gitignore
.assetsignore
node_modules
node_modules/**
src
src/**
tests
tests/**
audit
audit/**
screenshots
screenshots/**
uploads
uploads/**
CLAUDE.md
wrangler.jsonc
build.js
package.json
package-lock.json
_redirects
404.html
*.log
.DS_Store
